    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memória: % do limite declarado",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * sum by (container) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"jobops\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}) / sum by (container) (kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"jobops\",resource=\"memory\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{container}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 75
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Em proporcao do limite, e nao em bytes: a pergunta que importa e quanto falta para o teto, nao quanto se usa.\n\nAgregado por container: cada publicacao cria um nome de pod novo, e numa janela de horas a legenda mostraria a mesma carga repartida entre geracoes mortas."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU por container (millicores)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "1000 * sum by (container) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"jobops\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{container}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Em millicores, a mesma unidade que o Kubernetes usa nos manifestos. Em nucleos os valores em repouso ficavam na casa de 0,00005 e nao diziam nada.\n\nNao ha limite de CPU declarado, so requisicao — estrangular CPU num no unico costuma custar mais do que resolve."
    },
